---
/**
 * Modal Konfirmasi Darurat: Reset Antrian Harian Cabang
 * Mengharuskan pengguna mengetik "RESET" secara eksplisit sebelum tombol eksekusi aktif.
 */
---

<div
  id="reset-confirm-modal"
  class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden overflow-y-auto bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center p-4 transition-opacity duration-200"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="reset-modal-title"
>
  <div class="relative w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-rose-100 overflow-hidden transform transition-all">
    <!-- Header Warning -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-rose-50/70 border-b border-rose-100 flex items-start space-x-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 id="reset-modal-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-rose-950">
          Reset Antrian Harian
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-rose-700 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Tindakan darurat ini akan membatalkan seluruh tiket antrian yang tersisa hari ini dan mengembalikan seluruh loket ke status idle.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Body -->
    <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1">
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Harap berhati-hati:</p>
        <p>Tindakan ini tidak dapat dibatalkan. Seluruh nomor antrian akan dimulai ulang dari nomor 1.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="input-confirm-reset" class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1.5 uppercase tracking-wide">
          Ketik <span class="text-rose-600 select-all font-mono">RESET</span> untuk mengonfirmasi:
        </label>
        <input
          id="input-confirm-reset"
          type="text"
          placeholder="RESET"
          autocomplete="off"
          class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-mono tracking-widest text-center uppercase rounded-lg border border-slate-300 focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-500 focus:border-rose-500 transition-colors"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Feedback / Error message -->
      <div id="reset-error-msg" class="hidden text-xs font-semibold text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-rose-200"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Actions -->
    <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-end space-x-3">
      <button
        id="btn-cancel-reset"
        type="button"
        class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer"
      >
        Batal
      </button>
      <button
        id="btn-execute-reset"
        type="button"
        disabled
        class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-white bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 disabled:bg-slate-300 disabled:cursor-not-allowed rounded-lg shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-1.5"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16" />
        </svg>
        <span>Reset Antrian Sekarang</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
